msgid "Theorem scripts quoted on the package pages (`api/`, `design/`, `tutorial/`) reuse scripts from the anchors above; they do not introduce new script semantics."
msgstr "包页面（`api/`、`design/`、`tutorial/`）中引用的定理脚本复用上述锚点处的脚本，不引入新的脚本语义。"

#: manual/conformance.md:172
msgid "MoonBit API examples on the package pages are complete programs that call the public functions of the current code and record their results with `assert_eq`, `assert_true` or `inspect` snapshots. Every such block is compiled and run against the current code before the page changes; a block that is not meant to run is fenced `moonbit nocheck`."
msgstr "包页面中的 MoonBit API 示例是完整程序，调用当前代码的公开函数，并用 `assert_eq`、`assert_true` 或 `inspect` 快照记录结果。每个这样的代码块在页面变更之前都会针对当前代码编译并运行；不打算运行的代码块使用 `moonbit nocheck` 围栏标注。"

#: manual/conformance.md:176
msgid "If the documentation adds, modifies, or removes a public example, the corresponding regression test must be added, modified, or removed at the same time."
msgstr "若文档要新增、修改或删除公开示例，应同步新增、修改或删除对应回归测试。"

#: manual/conformance.md:179
msgid "Part II conformance obligations"
msgstr "Part II 符合性义务"

#: manual/conformance.md:181
msgid "Lean now states the Part II obligations of peripheral engineering explicitly as engineering obligations. The core items are:"
msgstr "Lean 中当前已经把外围工程的 Part II obligations 明确写成了工程义务。核心项包括："

#: manual/conformance.md:192
msgid "For contributors, the more actionable checklist is the following set of rules."
msgstr "对贡献者来说，更可执行的 checklist 是下面这组规则。"

#: manual/conformance.md:194
msgid "Contributor checklist"
msgstr "贡献者清单"

#: manual/conformance.md:196
msgid "`logic` may only provide checked wrappers, definition/unfold helpers, replay helpers, and organization of non-authoritative theorem references; it must not bypass the kernel to invent new rules."
msgstr "`logic` 只能做 checked wrapper、definition/unfold helper、replay helper 和非权威 theorem reference 组织；不能绕过 kernel invent 新规则。"

#: manual/conformance.md:199
msgid "`parser` must preserve `local > const` and the normalize + raw-offset contract, and must share the same connector contract with `logic`."
msgstr "`parser` 必须保持 `local > const`、normalize + raw-offset contract，并与 `logic` 共用同一套 connector contract。"

#: manual/conformance.md:201
msgid "`elab` must freeze resolved identity; when later typing encounters const-id or schema drift, it must fail closed."
msgstr "`elab` 必须冻结 resolved identity；后续 typing 遇到 const-id 或 schema drift 时必须 fail-closed。"

#: manual/conformance.md:203
msgid "`tactics` may hand out a theorem through `ps_qed` only when replay through `logic` constructs a `Thm` consistent with the sequent; otherwise it must fail closed."
msgstr "`tactics` 只能在通过 `logic` 回放构造出与相继式一致的 `Thm` 时，由 `ps_qed` 交出定理；否则必须 fail-closed。"

#: manual/conformance.md:205
msgid "Final acceptance in `ps_qed` must currently use strict normalized sequent equality; the old boundary that admitted results based only on shape-aware compatibility must not be kept."
msgstr "`ps_qed` 的最终验收当前必须按 strict normalized sequent equality 执行；不得保留仅按 shape-aware compatibility 放行的旧边界。"

#: manual/conformance.md:207
msgid "`prover` returns `Ok` and a `Thm` only when replay succeeds; otherwise it keeps returning honest errors."
msgstr "`prover` 仅在回放成功时返回 `Ok` 与 `Thm`；否则继续返回诚实错误。"

#: manual/conformance.md:209
msgid "`cmd` may only be a new non-authoritative integration layer and must not become a second proof kernel."
msgstr "`cmd` 只能是新的非权威集成层，不得成为第二证明内核。"

#: manual/conformance.md:211
msgid "Extension certificates may only be audit artifacts; they must not be treated as a substitute for theorem acceptance."
msgstr "extension certificate 只能是 audit artifact；不能被当成 theorem acceptance 的替代物。"

#: manual/conformance.md:214
msgid "The goal of this checklist is to progressively compress the executable frontend into what the paper calls a faithful realization, rather than adding a second logical system in peripheral engineering."
msgstr "这组 checklist 的目标，是把可执行前端逐步压成论文里所说的 faithful realization，而不是在外围工程里新增第二套逻辑系统。"

#: manual/conformance.md:217
msgid "Peripheral alignment"
msgstr "外围对齐"

#: manual/conformance.md:219
msgid "The engineering mainline of the current workspace is a deliberate consolidation:"
msgstr "当前工作区的工程主线是一次有意识的收口："

#: manual/conformance.md:221
msgid "The parser has moved from \"relying on a prelude constant of the same name existing in the state\" to \"basis-backed builder + resolve/lowering contract\"."
msgstr "parser 已从“依赖 state 中存在同名 prelude 常量”转为“basis-backed builder + resolve/lowering contract”。"

#: manual/conformance.md:223
msgid "Logic has advanced from \"registering surface symbol names\" to \"defined constants + definition theorem + unfold/replay helpers + small theorem catalog + shared theorem inventory\"."
msgstr "logic 已从“注册表面符号名”推进到“定义常量 + definition theorem + unfold/replay helper + 小型 theorem catalog + shared theorem inventory”。"

#: manual/conformance.md:225
msgid "Tactics/prover have moved from a purely operational prototype to \"the supported subset replays to kernel `Thm`, with the support matrix and honest failures pinned down by the canonical corpus\"."
msgstr "tactics/prover 已从纯 operational prototype 前进到“支持子集可 replay 到 kernel `Thm`，并由 canonical corpus 固定支持矩阵与 honest failure”。"

#: manual/conformance.md:228
msgid "For peripheral engineering to keep conforming to the current core, it should continue to:"
msgstr "若外围工程要继续符合现在的核心，应继续保持："

#: manual/conformance.md:230
msgid "extend replay builders on top of the shared theorem inventory and the canonical corpus;"
msgstr "在共享 theorem inventory 与 canonical corpus 之上继续扩展 replay builders；"

#: manual/conformance.md:231
msgid "write new shipped capabilities back into the canonical corpus / mapping matrix / manual anchors, so the documentation does not lag behind the implementation;"
msgstr "继续把新 shipped capability 写回 canonical corpus / mapping matrix / manual anchors，避免文档口径落后于实现；"

#: manual/conformance.md:233
msgid "turn goal / hole / unfinished-proof diagnostics into a formal frontend contract, while continuing to state explicitly that they are not proof objects;"
msgstr "把 goal / hole / unfinished-proof diagnostics 做成正式前端合同，但继续明确它们不是 proof object；"

#: manual/conformance.md:235
msgid "keep the parser/lowering/replay boundaries explicit for the shipped quantifier-facing path of theorem-header binders, as well as for the raw `forall` theorem-goal sugar;"
msgstr "对 theorem-header binder 这条已 shipped 的 quantifier-facing 路径，以及 raw `forall` theorem-goal sugar，继续保持 parser/lowering/replay 的边界显式化；"

#: manual/conformance.md:237
msgid "have `cmd` keep reusing the structured failure contract of `prover` instead of interpreting error strings on its own;"
msgstr "让 `cmd` 继续复用 `prover` 的 structured failure contract，而不是自行解释错误字符串；"

#: manual/conformance.md:239
msgid "keep expanding frontend expressiveness on top of the current file-first workflow."
msgstr "在当前 file-first workflow 之上继续扩大前端表达力。"

#: manual/conformance.md:241
msgid "These tasks should reuse the existing tools:"
msgstr "这些任务应当复用现有工具："

#: manual/conformance.md:251
msgid "Do not create a separate ad-hoc proof semantics that holds only inside tactic/prover but cannot be replayed to the kernel path."
msgstr "不应该另起一套仅在 tactic/prover 中成立、但无法 replay 到 kernel path 的临时证明语义。"

#: manual/conformance.md:254
msgid "Remaining non-shipped surfaces"
msgstr "其余未发布的界面"

#: manual/conformance.md:256
msgid "The capabilities that are still not shipped include:"
msgstr "当前仍然没有 shipped 的能力包括："

#: manual/conformance.md:258
msgid "the theorem catalog is still small and not yet enough to support a large body of more natural scripts; however, the inventory, mode boundaries, and corpus of the current shipped subset are already fixed;"
msgstr "theorem catalog 仍然偏小，尚不足以支撑更自然的大量脚本；但当前 shipped subset 的 inventory、mode 边界与 corpus 已经固定；"

#: manual/conformance.md:261
msgid "the canonical corpus still needs its hardening regressions filled in to complete the `H5` integration gate;"
msgstr "canonical corpus 还需要补齐 hardening regression，才能完成 `H5` 集成门；"

#: manual/conformance.md:263
msgid "the theorem-script body already supports minimal `M4b` structured branch blocks, but richer proof blocks are still not implemented;"
msgstr "theorem-script body 已支持最小 `M4b` 结构化分支块；但 richer proof block 仍未实现；"

#: manual/conformance.md:265
msgid "holes / unfinished proofs have now entered the shipped theorem-script surface, but hole completion / metavariable authority is still not implemented;"
msgstr "holes / unfinished proof 当前已进入 shipped theorem-script surface；但 hole completion / metavariable authority 仍未实现；"

#: manual/conformance.md:267
msgid "the theorem-header binder quantifier-facing surface is shipped; the raw `forall` / `∀` theorem-goal frontend is also supported as goal-only sugar;"
msgstr "theorem-header binder 这条 quantifier-facing surface 已 shipped；raw `forall` / `∀` theorem-goal frontend 也已作为 goal-only sugar 支持；"

#: manual/conformance.md:269
msgid "the parser-side utility surface has been consolidated into a non-script API; going forward, documentation and tests only need to be kept in sync;"
msgstr "parser-side utility surface 已收口为 non-script API；后续只需保持文档 / 测试同步；"

#: manual/conformance.md:271
msgid "the Lean line is currently a paper/conformance pack, not a direct mechanized proof of the MoonBit source."
msgstr "Lean 线当前是 paper/conformance pack，而不是 MoonBit 源码的直接机械化证明。"

#: manual/conformance.md:274
msgid "A more accurate assessment of the status is therefore:"
msgstr "因此更准确的状态判断是："

#: manual/conformance.md:276
msgid "the Part I core and the main conformance conventions of Part II are in place;"
msgstr "Part I 核心与 Part II 的主要符合性口径已经落地；"

#: manual/conformance.md:277
msgid "a theorem-producing frontend over the supported subset already exists;"
msgstr "支持子集上的 theorem-producing frontend 已经存在；"

#: manual/conformance.md:278
msgid "but a more complete faithful realization is still being consolidated."
msgstr "但更完整的 faithful realization 仍在继续收口。"

#: manual/conformance.md:280
msgid "Verification gate"
msgstr "验证闸门"

#: manual/conformance.md:282
msgid "The currently recommended paper-alignment / engineering-conformance gate is:"
msgstr "当前推荐的 paper-alignment / engineering-conformance 门禁是："

#: manual/conformance.md:291
msgid "When preparing to merge or freeze a release, also run:"
msgstr "准备合并或封板时，还应执行："

#: manual/conformance.md:301
#: manual/manual.md:905
msgid "Local check results:"
msgstr "本地检查结果："

