msgstr "2026-10-08，MoonBit `moonc` v0.10.14：`moon check --target all` 无警告，`moon test` 在 `wasm`、`wasm-gc`、`js` 和 `native` 目标上全部通过（357 个测试）"

#: manual/conformance.md:305
#: manual/manual.md:909
msgid "2026-04-05: `lake build` passes; `formal_verification/` has not changed since"
msgstr "2026-04-05：`lake build` 通过；此后 `formal_verification/` 未发生变化"

#: manual/conformance.md:307
msgid "When a change touches the trust boundary, scope, gates, the connector contract, proof scripting, or documentation conventions, also check:"
msgstr "当涉及 trust boundary、scope、gate、connector contract、proof scripting 或文档口径时，应同时检查："

