msgid "Packages"
msgstr "包"

#: manual/index.md:15
msgid "The packages are layered: each depends only on packages to its left, `kernel → logic/elab → parser → tactics → prover → cmd`, and only `kernel` is trusted."
msgstr "这些包是分层的：每个包只依赖其左侧的包，即 `kernel → logic/elab → parser → tactics → prover → cmd`，且只有 `kernel` 受信任。"

