#: manual/manual.md:6
msgid "Scope: current shipped behavior, beginner-facing usage, trust boundary, support matrix, and stable examples"
msgstr "范围：当前 shipped 行为、面向初学者的用法、信任边界、支持矩阵与稳定示例"

#: manual/manual.md:9
msgid "This document is both the current QED user manual and its implementation contract."
msgstr "本文档既是 QED 当前的用户手册，也是实现合同。"

#: manual/manual.md:11
msgid "It follows the MoonBit and Lean code in the current repository workspace and answers three questions:"
msgstr "它以当前仓库工作区中的 MoonBit 与 Lean 代码为准，用来回答三件事："

#: manual/manual.md:13
msgid "how an ordinary user actually writes and runs a small proof today;"
msgstr "普通用户现在怎样实际写出和运行一个小证明；"

#: manual/manual.md:14
msgid "what is actually implemented today;"
msgstr "现在真正实现了什么；"

#: manual/manual.md:15
msgid "what the surrounding tooling is currently allowed and not allowed to do."
msgstr "外围工程当前被允许做什么、不能做什么。"

#: manual/manual.md:17
msgid "For readers new to HOL"
msgstr "先给第一次接触 HOL 的读者"

#: manual/manual.md:19
msgid "If you have not used proof assistants such as HOL, Lean, HOL Light, or Isabelle before, the following intuitions are enough to understand the subset QED currently ships:"
msgstr "如果你以前没有接触过 HOL、Lean、HOL Light、Isabelle 这类证明助手，可以先用下面这组直觉理解 QED 当前 shipped 的子集："

#: manual/manual.md:22
msgid "A \"proof\" here is not a natural-language paragraph but a script that the kernel checks."
msgstr "这里的“证明”不是自然语言段落，而是一段会被内核检查的 script。"

#: manual/manual.md:23
msgid "The goals currently shipped are mainly a minimal propositional-logic subset, plus a small amount of equality and theorem replay."
msgstr "当前 shipped 的目标主要是最小命题逻辑子集，加上一小部分等式与 theorem replay。"

#: manual/manual.md:25
msgid "`⊢ goal` means \"prove `goal` with no premises\"."
msgstr "`⊢ goal` 表示“在空前提下证明 `goal`”。"

#: manual/manual.md:26
msgid "`A, B ⊢ goal` means \"prove `goal` under the hypotheses `A` and `B`\"."
msgstr "`A, B ⊢ goal` 表示“在假设 `A` 和 `B` 的前提下证明 `goal`”。"

#: manual/manual.md:27
msgid "Intuitively, read `T` as \"the always-true proposition\" and `F` as \"the false proposition\"."
msgstr "`T` 可以先直觉地理解成“永真命题”，`F` 理解成“假命题”。"

#: manual/manual.md:28
msgid "`A -> B` means \"given `A`, you can derive `B`\"."
msgstr "`A -> B` 表示“如果有 `A`，就可以推出 `B`”。"

#: manual/manual.md:29
msgid "`A ∧ B` means \"prove both `A` and `B`\"."
msgstr "`A ∧ B` 表示“同时证明 `A` 和 `B`”。"

#: manual/manual.md:30
msgid "`A ∨ B` means \"proving one side of `A` or `B` suffices, but you must explicitly choose left or right\"."
msgstr "`A ∨ B` 表示“证明 `A` 或 `B` 中的一边即可，但要明确选左边还是右边”。"

#: manual/manual.md:31
msgid "`P = Q` denotes equality; the currently shipped subset also supports a small amount of equality-related theorem replay."
msgstr "`P = Q` 表示等式；当前 shipped 子集里也支持少量等式相关 theorem replay。"

#: manual/manual.md:34
msgid "Roughly, a theorem script is currently a sequence of \"goal-directed proof steps\":"
msgstr "当前 theorem script 可以先粗略理解成“面向目标的证明步骤”："

#: manual/manual.md:36
msgid "`intro h`: if the current goal is `A -> B`, it becomes \"add a local hypothesis `A` named `h` and continue proving `B`\"."
msgstr "`intro h`：如果当前目标是 `A -> B`，就把它变成“新增一个叫 `h` 的局部假设 `A`，继续证明 `B`”。"

#: manual/manual.md:38
msgid "`exact h`: if `h` is already direct evidence for the current goal, it closes the goal immediately."
msgstr "`exact h`：如果 `h` 已经是当前目标的直接证据，就立刻闭合。"

#: manual/manual.md:39
msgid "`assumption`: searches the current local hypotheses for evidence that matches the goal."
msgstr "`assumption`：在当前局部假设里找与目标匹配的证据。"

#: manual/manual.md:40
msgid "`apply th`: applies an implication theorem or a local implication hypothesis to the current goal, producing new subgoals."
msgstr "`apply th`：把某个蕴含型 theorem 或局部蕴含假设用于当前目标，产生新的子目标。"

#: manual/manual.md:42
msgid "`split`: when the goal is `A ∧ B`, splits it into two subgoals."
msgstr "`split`：当目标是 `A ∧ B` 时，拆成两个子目标。"

#: manual/manual.md:43
msgid "`left` / `right`: when the goal is `A ∨ B`, explicitly chooses to prove the left or the right branch."
msgstr "`left` / `right`：当目标是 `A ∨ B` 时，显式选择证明左支或右支。"

#: manual/manual.md:44
msgid "`hole`: admits that this point is not proved yet; the system returns a structured unfinished result instead of faking success."
msgstr "`hole`：承认这里还没证明完，系统会返回结构化 unfinished 结果，而不是伪造成功。"

#: manual/manual.md:47
msgid "These intuitions are enough to start reading the first few examples in this user manual; the full boundaries, rule names, and support matrix come later."
msgstr "这份直觉足够支撑你开始读用户手册里的前几个例子；更完整的边界、规则名称和支持矩阵见后文。"

#: manual/manual.md:50
msgid "Getting started order"
msgstr "上手顺序"

#: manual/manual.md:52
msgid "We recommend starting in this order:"
msgstr "建议按下面顺序开始："

#: manual/manual.md:54
msgid "Run `moon build` and `moon test` first to confirm the workspace itself is green."
msgstr "先跑 `moon build` 和 `moon test`，确认工作区本身是绿的。"

#: manual/manual.md:55
msgid "Use `src/cmd` to run a fully state-free theorem file and get familiar with the input and output format."
msgstr "用 `src/cmd` 跑一个完全 state-free 的定理文件，先熟悉输入输出格式。"

#: manual/manual.md:56
msgid "Then try examples with theorem-header binders to understand \"how local variables enter the proof context\"."
msgstr "再尝试带 theorem-header binder 的例子，理解“局部变量如何进入证明上下文”。"

#: manual/manual.md:57
msgid "Finally, read the support matrix, failure matrix, and implementation contract to understand which capabilities are shipped and which are not."
msgstr "最后再看支持矩阵、failure matrix 和实现合同，理解哪些能力是 shipped，哪些还没有。"

#: manual/manual.md:60
#: manual/syntax.md:15
#: manual/tutorial/cmd.md:5
#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:5
#: manual/tutorial/kernel.md:5
#: manual/tutorial/logic.md:5
