msgstr "parser normalize/raw-offset/theorem-script raw parsing, including sequential block bodies、structured branch blocks、theorem-header binders、hole step，以及 raw binder/goal/step spans"

#: manual/manual.md:587
msgid "a quantifier-facing script surface driven by theorem-header binders, with the corresponding prover/cmd goal, locals, branch, and unfinished-proof summaries"
msgstr "theorem-header binder 驱动的 quantifier-facing script surface，以及对应的 prover/cmd goal、locals、branch、unfinished-proof 摘要"

