msgstr "任意脚本的完备性"

#: manual/manual.md:605
#: manual/manual.md:875
msgid "Current extension contract"
msgstr "当前扩展契约"

#: manual/manual.md:607
msgid "the theorem-name inventory, corpus, mapping matrix, and docs use the same set of shipped anchors;"
msgstr "theorem-name inventory、corpus、mapping matrix 与 docs 使用同一组 shipped anchors；"

#: manual/manual.md:608
msgid "nested proof blocks continue to be organized through the current checked replay boundary;"
msgstr "nested proof blocks 继续通过当前 checked replay boundary 组织；"

#: manual/manual.md:609
msgid "hole / unfinished-proof remains a frontend contract, not kernel metavariable authority;"
msgstr "hole / unfinished-proof 继续是 frontend contract，不是 kernel metavariable authority；"

#: manual/manual.md:610
msgid "theorem-header binders remain part of the currently shipped quantifier-facing syntax and stay in sync with the corpus / matrix;"
msgstr "theorem-header binder 继续作为当前 shipped quantifier-facing 语法的一部分，并保持与 corpus / matrix 同步；"

#: manual/manual.md:612
msgid "a new public example must enter the regression tests first, and only then the documentation anchors."
msgstr "新增公开示例时，必须先进入回归测试，再进入文档锚点。"

#: manual/manual.md:614
msgid "Stable theorem-name surface"
msgstr "稳定的定理名称界面"

#: manual/manual.md:616
#: manual/manual.md:659
msgid "Surface"
msgstr "界面"

#: manual/manual.md:616
msgid "Current supported capability"
msgstr "当前支持的能力"

#: manual/manual.md:616
msgid "Stable theorem names"
msgstr "稳定的定理名称"

#: manual/manual.md:618
msgid "local hypothesis witness, theorem entries with exact capability"
msgstr "局部假设见证，具备 exact 能力的定理条目"

#: manual/manual.md:619
msgid "local implication, implication-backed named theorem, implication-backed context theorem"
msgstr "局部蕴含、由蕴含支撑的具名定理、由蕴含支撑的上下文定理"

#: manual/manual.md:623
msgid "`exact` consumes only the exact capability and never implicitly degrades into `apply`. This covers both direct-close entries and context-derived exact entries; local `exact h` must also interpret `h` as a direct witness of the current sequent, and `h` must still be an active hypothesis alias, not a shape-based guess or some other local artifact."
msgstr "`exact` 只消费 exact capability；不会隐式退化成 `apply`。这既包括 direct-close entry，也包括 context-derived exact entry；local `exact h` 也必须把 `h` 解释成当前 sequent 的直接 witness，并且 `h` 必须仍然是 active hypothesis alias，而不是 shape-based 猜测或其它 local artifact。"

#: manual/manual.md:627
msgid "`apply` consumes only the implication-backed capability; it never accepts a direct-close theorem name as an implication."
msgstr "`apply` 只消费 implication-backed capability；不会把 direct-close theorem name 当成 implication 接受。"

#: manual/manual.md:629
msgid "Wrong-mode theorem usage keeps failing honestly; `exact or_intro_l` currently returns `GoalShapeMismatch`, local `exact h` also returns `GoalShapeMismatch` if `h` is not a direct witness of the current goal; `apply truth`, `apply ex_falso`, and `apply not_elim` must all currently return `ApplyMismatch`."
msgstr "wrong-mode theorem usage 继续诚实失败；`exact or_intro_l` 当前返回 `GoalShapeMismatch`，local `exact h` 若 `h` 不是当前 goal 的直接 witness 也返回 `GoalShapeMismatch`；`apply truth`、`apply ex_falso`、`apply not_elim` 当前都必须返回 `ApplyMismatch`。"

#: manual/manual.md:633
msgid "Local name resolution still follows `local > theorem name`."
msgstr "local name resolution 仍保持 `local > theorem name`。"

#: manual/manual.md:635
msgid "M3c corpus / mapping matrix"
