msgstr "另外，`⊢ (forall (x : bool), x -> x)` 这类带外层括号的写法当前也被 parser / prover 接受；它沿用同一条 raw-goal-sugar lowering path，只是当前不单独占用 corpus case id。"

#: manual/manual.md:776
msgid "Readers without a HOL background can first understand these quantifier examples as follows:"
msgstr "对没有 HOL 基础的读者，可以把这些量词例子先理解成："

#: manual/manual.md:778
msgid "a theorem can first declare a local variable, such as `(x : bool)`;"
msgstr "theorem 里可以先声明一个局部变量，比如 `(x : bool)`；"

#: manual/manual.md:779
msgid "the goal that follows can then refer to this variable directly;"
msgstr "后面的目标里就可以直接引用这个变量；"

#: manual/manual.md:780
msgid "a raw `forall` theorem goal is currently lowered to the same binder-oriented replay path."
msgstr "raw `forall` theorem goal 当前会 lowering 到同一条 binder-oriented replay path。"

#: manual/manual.md:782
msgid "The currently shipped quantifier frontend includes the binder entry and raw `forall` goal sugar; raw `forall` is still not accepted in term positions. This means users can now write and prove `forall` theorem goals, but it is still not general term-level quantifier syntax, and it adds no kernel primitive quantifier authority."
msgstr "当前 shipped 的量词前端包含 binder 入口和 raw `forall` goal sugar；term 位置仍不接受 raw `forall`。这意味着用户现在已经可以写出并证明 `forall` theorem goal，但它仍然不是通用 term-level quantifier syntax，也没有新增 kernel primitive quantifier authority。"

