msgid "The theorem-header binder syntax currently uses the same set of fields and the same kind of blame reporting; for the corresponding canonical corpus anchors, see `src/cmd/cmd_corpus_wbtest.mbt`."
msgstr "theorem-header binder 语法当前使用同一组字段与同一类 blame 口径；对应 canonical corpus 锚点见 `src/cmd/cmd_corpus_wbtest.mbt`。"

#: manual/manual.md:877
msgid "The executable frontend may currently only be extended along the same set of shipped anchors:"
msgstr "当前可执行前端只允许沿着同一套 shipped anchors 扩展："

#: manual/manual.md:879
msgid "the theorem inventory, mode-aware resolver, corpus, mapping matrix, and docs keep a single source;"
msgstr "theorem inventory、mode-aware resolver、corpus、mapping matrix 与 docs 保持单一来源；"

#: manual/manual.md:880
msgid "structured branch blocks, as a prover-side script contract, keep reusing the existing checked replay boundary;"
msgstr "structured branch block 作为 prover-side 脚本合同，继续复用现有 checked replay boundary；"

#: manual/manual.md:881
msgid "hole / unfinished proof remains a frontend-only contract and does not enter kernel metavariable authority;"
msgstr "hole / unfinished proof 继续保持 frontend-only contract，不进入 kernel metavariable authority；"

#: manual/manual.md:882
msgid "theorem-header binders remain part of the currently shipped quantifier-facing user syntax;"
msgstr "theorem-header binder 继续作为当前 shipped quantifier-facing 用户语法的一部分；"

