msgstr "当前 `src/cmd` 工作流是 file-first；单 theorem 文件可省略末尾 `qed`，多 theorem 文件用 `qed` 分隔。"

#: manual/syntax.md:291
msgid "Directly runnable public examples should preferably use the existing scripts in `examples/`."
msgstr "直接 runnable 的公开例子应优先使用 `examples/` 中已有脚本。"

#: manual/syntax.md:292
msgid "Theorem-header binders are shipped; raw `forall` theorem goals are supported as goal-only sugar, while term-level forms are still unsupported."
msgstr "theorem-header binder 已 shipped；raw `forall` theorem goal 作为 goal-only sugar 已支持，term-level 仍不支持。"

#: manual/syntax.md:294
msgid "Unsupported paths must fail closed and never fake theorem success."
msgstr "不支持的路径必须 fail-closed，不会伪造 theorem success。"

#: manual/syntax.md:295
msgid "`hole` returns unfinished, not theorem success."
msgstr "`hole` 返回 unfinished，不返回 theorem success。"

#: manual/syntax.md:297
msgid "Output shape"
msgstr "输出形状"

#: manual/syntax.md:299
msgid "Current CLI output falls into three categories:"
msgstr "当前 CLI 输出分三类："

#: manual/syntax.md:301
msgid "Success: by default, one line `ok <theorem_name>` per theorem; with `-d`, the output is `ok <theorem_name>: <conclusion_summary>`"
msgstr "成功：默认每个 theorem 输出一行 `ok <theorem_name>`；使用 `-d` 时输出 `ok <theorem_name>: <conclusion_summary>`"

#: manual/syntax.md:303
